      "reasoning": "Whoa — **Chandra, Heart of Fire** just hit the battlefield with 5 loyalty! That's a major threat. The opponent tapped all 5 Mountains to cast it. Chandra can deal 2 damage to any target every turn, or dig through cards. That's very dangerous.\n\
