      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Used Outnumber (which scales with creature count) to deal just 1 damage to kill Prismite, when Pillar of Flame in hand could accomplish the same thing postcombat. Outnumber has much higher potential value later when more creatures are on board (Boggart Brute, Ornery Goblin, Goblin Shortcutter all in hand).",
