    },
    {
      "severity": "major",
      "description": "GPT52 Philo used Outnumber to kill their own attacking Goblin Arsonist during combat. This wastes a card (Outnumber) and a creature for at most 1 damage from the death trigger, when the Arsonist was already attacking unblocked and would deal 1 combat damage anyway. Outnumber scales with creature count and is much better saved for later when they have more creatures on the board.",
