    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Directed Goblin Arsonist's death trigger at the opponent's face (20 life) instead of killing Prismite, a 2/1 mana-fixing creature. At 20 life, 1 damage to face is nearly meaningless, while removing Prismite eliminates both a body and the opponent's ability to fix mana for multicolor spells.",
