    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Cast Goblin Shortcutter (2/1) before playing the Mountain land drop. Playing Mountain first would have enabled casting Boggart Brute (3/2 menace) instead, which is a significantly better creature. The Shortcutter's ETB is also wasted since the opponent has no creatures. Even if Shortcutter was the intended play, lands should be played before spells to maximize options.",
