      "description": "GPT52 Philo timed out and passed their entire precombat main phase with 3 untapped Mountains and multiple excellent plays available. The opponent just tapped out for Talrand's Invocation creating two 2/2 flyers that are summoning sick. This was the perfect window to use Flames of the Firebrand to kill a Drake token while the opponent couldn't respond, then attack with Boggart Brute through the remaining single blocker (menace). Instead, nothing was cast, no land was played, and the opponent gets to untap with both Drakes ready to attack and block.",
